#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:5
msgid ""
"Discrete diffusion generation for proteins with the generic `Q-Diffusion` "
"core (`src/kaiwu/torch_plugin/qdiffusion.py`) and a DPLM backbone: load a "
"UniProt proteome FASTA, train with the `objective(...)` interface, and "
"generate sequences with `generate(...)`."
msgstr ""
"使用通用 `Q-Diffusion` 核心（`src/kaiwu/torch_plugin/qdiffusion.py`）与 DPLM "
"骨干网络进行蛋白质离散扩散生成：加载 UniProt 蛋白质组 FASTA、通过 `objective(...)` 接口训练、并使用 "
"`generate(...)` 生成序列。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:7
msgid ""
"**Examples**: `example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py` · "
"`example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_generate_example.py`"
msgstr ""
"**示例**：`example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py` · "
"`example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_generate_example.py`"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:9
msgid ""
